ns 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 32% of normal in September to October and 182% in May to June. So far in 2026 March to April sits at 43% and May to June at 198%. All 6 grids had their driest year in 1954, with grids 13975 and 14275 at 51%.</p>"}
